OL,3,GNEWSAHow community DIY store keeps
OL,4,Aitems out of landfill
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of new and unused building
OL,7,Fproducts and materials are being saved
OL,8,Ffrom landfill and offered to customers
OL,9,Fat a fraction of the usual price at a
OL,10,Fproject in Somerset.
OL,12,FPaint, wood and tiles are among the
OL,13,Fitems which can be bought at Fromebase,
OL,14,Fin Frome, in person and via an online
OL,15,Fshop. It aims is to reduce the amount
OL,16,Fof waste in the construction industry.
OL,18,FLatest government figures from show in
OL,19,F2024, England generated 63.3 million
OL,20,Ftonnes of non-hazardous construction
OL,21,Fand demolition waste.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
