OL,3,GNEWSAHow community DIY store keeps
OL,4,Aitems out of landfill
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlan Foxon, from Melksham, uses
OL,7,FFromebase regularly: "You're re-using
OL,8,Fmaterial or using material that
OL,9,Fotherwise would have been put in a skip
OL,10,Fsomewhere on a building site."
